// Local.xcconfig.example — template for machine-local signing settings.
//
// Setup (one time, after cloning):
//   1. Copy this file to `Local.xcconfig` (same folder, next to
//      MultiSub.xcodeproj). `Local.xcconfig` is gitignored.
//   2. Replace YOUR_TEAM_ID below with your own 10-character Apple Team ID.
//      Find it in Xcode ▸ Settings ▸ Accounts (select your Apple ID ▸ the
//      team row shows the ID in parentheses), or at
//      developer.apple.com/account ▸ Membership details. A free Personal
//      Team is sufficient — see README's build instructions.
//
// Xcode uses DEVELOPMENT_TEAM to code-sign the app and its Safari extension.
// The App Group container the app and extension share is keyed off this team
// ID at run time, so signing with your own team just works — no source edits.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
